Upstream-Name: rk3399-vpu-dkms
Comment: src/ is Linux's drivers/media/platform/verisilicon as shipped in
 Debian's linux-source-6.12 (6.12.113-1), with changes listed in README.md.
 Rockchip MPP (Apache-2.0) was read for hardware behaviour only; none of
 its code is included.

